    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gordon Hughes Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market Knockmark a small holding comprising of a four bedroomed detached bungalow, yard and outbuilding all sitting on a generous site of c. 1.4acres. \n\nThe property is a nice sized bungalow, consisting of: - entrance porch, entrance hall, sittingroom, open plan kitchen/diner/living room, utility room, four bedrooms master with ensuite & family bathroom. The property will require some refurbishment and modernisation but is a great opportunity for prospective purchasers to put their own stamp on the property and make it their own!\n\nOutside, the property sits on a substantial site being approx. 1.4acres, allowing for ample space to extend in whichever direction you so choose, subject to the required permissions. To the rear of the site lies a substantial concrete yard with an array of outbuildings including four generous sized stables. A real benefit of Knockmark is that there is also rear lane access meaning the yard and house could be separated, if required. \n\nLocated in the sought after area of Drumree offering a mix of country living with accessibility - c.5.1km from Dunshaughlin and c. 4.6km from the M4 motorway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch 1.87m x 0.75m With tiled flooring. Door leads through to…\n\nEntrance Hall 1.87m x 3.65m & Corridor 7.80m x 0.97m With tiled flooring and pine panelled ceiling. \n\nLivingroom 4.02m x 3.48m Located to the front of the property fitted with coving and open fireplace. \n\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Diner/Livingroom \nLocated to the rear of the property. The living section measures 4.02m x 4.36m is fitted with laminate flooring, pine panelled ceiling and a central fireplace with stove fitted. The kitchen section 4.86m x 3.34m is fitted with wall and floor units, tiled flooring, tiled splashback and pine panelled ceiling. Door leads through to.. Utility 1.84m x 2.16m which has tiled flooring and door leading out to the rear of the property. \n\nMaster Bedroom 3.55m x 3.44m Located to the front of the property and fitted with laminate flooring. Also hosts En-Suite 1.64m x 1.55m. \n\nBedroom 2.87m x 3.44m Located to the front of the property, fitted with coving and laminate flooring. \n\nBedroom 2.81m x 3.44m Also located to the front of the property. \n\nBedroom 2.71m x 3.34m Located to the rear of the property - fitted with laminate flooring and coving. \n\nBathroom 1.79m x 3.34m A generous sized bathroom fitted with wc, whb and bath. Tiled flooring and bath area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Four bedroomed detached bungalow with yard and outbuildings, all sitting on a generous site of c. 1.4acres.\nRear lane access making it easy to separate the yard from the dwelling, if so required. \nServices: Oil fired central heating, private well & septic tank. \nBER: E1. BER Number: 118533348\nc.5.1km from Dunshaughlin. \nc.4.6km from the M3 motorway."
      },
